Introduction (~5 min)

- Two years ago, I moved positions and began teaching Python instead of R
- As a longtime R and RStudio user, I was a bit terrified of the transition
- Fortunately, that summer Positon entered open beta (thanks to Julia and team)
- "VS Code is too general, RStudio is too specific, but Positron is just right"
- But after actually teaching Python, I discovered I was actually in a different story
- A story I'm calling "Positron and the Three Bears"

